#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:79
msgid ""
"A missing twin is a hard error listing the affected terms, so a partially "
"covered task fails at build time rather than silently changing behavior. "
"Rough-terrain velocity configurations that use ``height_scan`` cannot "
"currently be adapted: that observation term has no Warp twin. Check the "
"terms used by a task rather than assuming that every terrain configuration "
"has the same limitation."
msgstr ""
"缺少对应项会直接报错，并列出受影响的项，因此仅部分覆盖的任务在构建时就会失败，而不会静默改变行为。目前无法适配使用 ``height_scan`` "
"的崎岖地形速度配置，因为该观测项没有 Warp 对应实现。应检查任务实际使用的项，不要假定所有地形配置都有同样限制。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:87
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:105
msgid ""
"All RL libraries with warp-compatible wrappers are supported: RSL-RL, RL "
"Games, SKRL, and Stable-Baselines3."
msgstr "支持所有具有 Warp 兼容包装器的强化学习库：RSL-RL、RL Games、SKRL 和 Stable-Baselines3。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:110
msgid ""
"``--video`` is rejected on the warp path, for both ``train`` and ``play``: "
"video recording requires the standard torch frontend. To record a rollout, "
"replay the same checkpoint with ``--frontend torch``; see "
":ref:`how_to_record_video`."
msgstr ""
"Warp 路径的 ``train`` 和 ``play`` 均不接受 ``--video`` ，视频录制需要标准 Torch 前端。要录制轨迹，请通过 "
"``--frontend torch`` 回放同一检查点；见 :ref:`how_to_record_video` 。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:116
msgid "Performance Comparison"
msgstr "性能对比"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:118
msgid ""
"Historical step time comparison between the stable (torch/manager) and warp "
"(CUDA graph captured) variants, both running on the Newton physics backend. "
"Measured over 300 iterations with 4096 environments. The table covers the "
"measured tasks, not every currently supported task. These figures are "
"retained as the original benchmark record, not a measurement of the latest "
"``develop`` revision. For updated results, record the hardware and Isaac "
"Lab, Newton, and Warp revisions, and compare both frontends on those same "
"revisions. Improvements in shared base libraries can benefit both frontends "
"and must not be attributed solely to the Warp frontend."
msgstr ""
"下表是稳定版（Torch/管理器）与 Warp（CUDA 图捕获）变体的历史步进时间对比，两者都运行于 Newton 物理后端。测量使用 4096 "
"个环境、300 次迭代，覆盖所测任务，而非当前所有支持的任务。这些数值作为原始基准记录保留，不代表最新 ``develop`` "
"版本的测量结果。更新结果时，应记录硬件及 Isaac Lab、Newton、Warp "
"的版本，并在相同版本上对比两个前端。共享基础库的改进可能同时惠及两者，不能全部归因于 Warp 前端。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:128
msgid ""
"The warp migration is an ongoing effort. Several components (e.g. scene "
"write, actuator models) have not yet been migrated to Warp kernels and still"
" run through torch. Further performance improvements are expected as these "
"components are migrated."
msgstr ""
"向 Warp 迁移仍在进行中。部分组件（例如场景写入、执行器模型）尚未迁移到 Warp 内核，仍通过 Torch "
"运行。随着这些组件迁移，预计性能会进一步提高。"

